&ANALYZE-SUSPEND _UIB-CODE-BLOCK _PROCEDURE openQueryRangeCampanha DBOProgram 
PROCEDURE openQueryRangeCampanha :
/*------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Purpose:     
  Parameters:  <none>
  Notes:       
------------------------------------------------------------------------------*/

    OPEN QUERY qr{&TableName} FOR EACH {&TableName}
                                  WHERE {&TableName}.cod-campanha >= c-cod-campanha-ini
                                  AND   {&TableName}.cod-campanha <= c-cod-campanha-fim NO-LOCK.

END PROCEDURE.

